# Byte-exact storage: files in this tree are covered by SHA-256 manifests
# (brand/manifests/SHA256SUMS and the governance manifest). The repository has
# core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite LF to CRLF on checkout and break every
# recorded hash on a fresh clone. -text disables all line-ending conversion so
# the working tree always matches the bytes the hashes were computed over.
* -text
